bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">class MathUtil:\r\n    PI = 3.14                          # 클래스 변수 (static 필드)\r\n\r\n    @staticmethod\r\n    def circle(r: float) -&gt; float:     # self 없음\r\n        return MathUtil.PI * r * r\r\n\r\nclass User:\r\n    count = 0\r\n\r\n    @classmethod\r\n    def from_dict(cls, d: dict) -&gt; &quot;User&quot;:   # 대체 생성자 — cls 는 클래스 자신\r\n        return cls(d[&quot;id&quot;], d[&quot;name&quot;])\r\n\r\nMathUtil.circle(2)</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › static, Java › static</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/python/class/static","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"python","title":"PYTHON","path":"it/syntax/python"},{"id":"class","title":"클래스","path":"it/syntax/python/class"}],"hasImage":false}